    affiliation: "Centro Nacional Instituto Geológico y Minero de España (CN IGME-CSIC)"

version: "1.1.0"
date-released: 2026-09-11

license: "EUPL-1.2"

repository-code: "https://github.com/CarlosMarinLechado/LogDigitizer"
url: "https://github.com/CarlosMarinLechado/LogDigitizer"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23263539"

abstract: >
  LogDigitizer is an open-source scientific desktop application for recovering
  quantitative geophysical and petrophysical well-log curves from scanned
  legacy raster images. It provides image preprocessing and rectification,
  depth and curve calibration, manual and semi-automatic digitization,
  quality control, curve preview, and export to LAS 2.0 format.

keywords:
  - well logs
  - legacy data
  - raster digitization
  - geophysics
  - petrophysics
  - LAS 2.0
  - scientific software